<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Station 7 — Escape Game Maths</title>
  <style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #EEEDFE;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px 12px 40px;
}
.wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 460px; }
.top-bar {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.badge {
  background: #534AB7; color: white;
  border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 14px;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .3px;
}
.station-num {
  width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: #534AB7; color: white;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;
}
.card {
  background: white; border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(83,74,183,.12);
}
.card h2 {
  color: #534AB7; font-size: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.3;
}
.contexte {
  background: #F1EFE8; border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 13px 15px; font-size: 13.5px;
  color: #444441; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.question {
  background: #EEEDFE; border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 14px 15px; font-size: 14.5px;
  font-weight: 600; color: #26215C; line-height: 1.5;
  border-left: 4px solid #534AB7;
}
.question small {
  display: block; font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 12.5px; color: #534AB7; margin-top: 6px;
}
.input-row { margin-top: 16px; }
.input-row label {
  display: block; font-size: 12px;
  color: #888; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 500;
}
input[type=number] {
  width: 100%; padding: 13px 16px;
  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;
  border: 2px solid #C8C5F0;
  border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;
  color: #26215C; outline: none;
  transition: border-color .2s;
}
input:focus { border-color: #534AB7; }
.btn {
  display: block; width: 100%;
  margin-top: 12px; padding: 15px;
  font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
  background: #534AB7; color: white;
  border: none; border-radius: 10px;
  cursor: pointer; letter-spacing: .3px;
  transition: background .15s, transform .1s;
}
.btn:hover  { background: #3C3489; }
.btn:active { transform: scale(.98); }
.msg {
  border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 18px 16px;
  margin-top: 14px; display: none; line-height: 1.6;
}
.msg-correct {
  background: #E1F5EE;
  border-left: 5px solid #1D9E75;
}
.msg-correct strong.title { color: #0F6E56; font-size: 15px; }
.lettre-box { text-align: center; margin: 14px 0 10px; }
.lettre {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 64px; font-weight: 800;
  color: white; background: #1D9E75;
  width: 90px; height: 90px; line-height: 90px;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
.note {
  font-size: 13px; color: #0F6E56;
  text-align: center; font-style: italic; margin-top: 6px;
}
.corrige {
  background: #f0fdf7; border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 14px; margin: 12px 0;
  font-size: 13px; color: #27500A;
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.msg-wrong {
  background: #FAEEDA;
  border-left: 5px solid #BA7517;
}
.msg-wrong strong.title { color: #854F0B; font-size: 15px; }
.indice-txt {
  font-size: 13.5px; color: #633806; margin-top: 8px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.retry-btn {
  display: block; width: 100%;
  margin-top: 12px; padding: 11px;
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
  background: transparent; color: #BA7517;
  border: 2px solid #BA7517; border-radius: 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.retry-btn:hover { background: #fff3e0; }
.footer {
  text-align: center; font-size: 11px;
  color: #888; margin-top: 20px;
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="top-bar">
    <span class="badge">🔐 Escape Game Maths — PIPAC</span>
    <div class="station-num">7</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>📏 Station 7/10 — Aire d'une figure complexe</h2>

    <div class="contexte">
      La salle de restauration a une forme particulière.<br>
      Elle est composée d'un <strong>grand rectangle de 14 m × 9 m</strong>,
      dont on retranche un <strong>triangle rectangle</strong> situé dans
      l'angle supérieur droit :<br><br>
      — Base du triangle : <strong>5 m</strong><br>
      — Hauteur du triangle : <strong>4 m</strong><br><br>
      <em>Aire totale = Aire du rectangle − Aire du triangle</em>
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      Quelle est l'<strong>aire totale du sol</strong> de la salle de restauration ?
      <small>Donner le résultat en m², nombre entier</small>
    </div>

    <div class="input-row">
      <label>Votre réponse :</label>
      <input type="number" id="reponse" placeholder="?" step="any" inputmode="decimal">
      <button class="btn" onclick="verifier()">✅ Valider ma réponse</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="msg msg-correct" id="msg-correct">
    <strong class="title">🎉 Bravo, bonne réponse !</strong>
    <div class="corrige">
      Aire du rectangle = longueur × largeur<br>
                        = 14 × 9 = 126 m²<br>
      Aire du triangle  = (base × hauteur) ÷ 2<br>
                        = (5 × 4) ÷ 2 = 20 ÷ 2 = 10 m²<br>
      Aire totale = 126 − 10 = 116 m²
    </div>
    <div class="lettre-box">
      <div class="lettre">V</div>
      <div class="note">📝 Notez cette lettre sur votre feuille de route !</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="msg msg-wrong" id="msg-wrong">
    <strong class="title">💡 Pas encore... voici un indice :</strong>
    <div class="indice-txt">
      Deux formules à connaître :<br>
      <strong>Aire rectangle</strong> = longueur × largeur = 14 × 9<br>
      <strong>Aire triangle rectangle</strong> = (base × hauteur) ÷ 2 = (5 × 4) ÷ 2<br><br>
      Soustrayez l'aire du triangle de l'aire du rectangle.<br>
      <em>Astuce : 126 − 10 = ?</em>
    </div>
    <button class="retry-btn" onclick="reinitialiser()">🔄 Réessayer</button>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">Terminale PIPAC &nbsp;·&nbsp; Établissement ENILIA ENSMIC</div>

</div>
<script>
const BONNE_REPONSE = 116;
const TYPE = 'int';

function verifier() {
  const raw = document.getElementById('reponse').value.replace(',', '.');
  const val = TYPE === 'float' ? parseFloat(raw) : parseInt(raw);
  const ok  = document.getElementById('msg-correct');
  const ko  = document.getElementById('msg-wrong');
  ok.style.display = 'none';
  ko.style.display = 'none';
  if (!isNaN(val) && Math.abs(val - BONNE_REPONSE) < 0.05) {
    ok.style.display = 'block';
    ok.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth', block:'center'});
  } else {
    ko.style.display = 'block';
    ko.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth', block:'center'});
  }
}

function reinitialiser() {
  document.getElementById('reponse').value = '';
  document.getElementById('msg-correct').style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('msg-wrong').style.display   = 'none';
  document.getElementById('reponse').focus();
}

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  document.getElementById('reponse').addEventListener('keypress', function(e) {
    if (e.key === 'Enter') verifier();
  });
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
